==Rules==
{{StageRule|12thAnni}}

==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Bannerman Doge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*4 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Le'noir]] spawns as the boss.
**8 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 40~53.33 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,600f</sup>.
**2 [[Otta-smack-u]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**2 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.

