==Trivia==
*Reimen Domain is named after the Japanese word 冷麺 ''reimen'' (''[[wikipedia:naengmyeon|naengmyeon]]'', a Korean cold noodle dish).
**In particular, the stage likely points to [[wikipedia:Morioka reimen|Morioka reimen]], a local dish of the capital city of [[wikipedia:Iwate Prefecture|Iwate Prefecture]] where the stage is located on the in-game map.

